If you're using weapon or ray attacks, that'll always anger the
monster before it takes any damage, so you don't run any risk of a
luck penalty from its dying peaceful. The most likely way to incur
that is by a beam attack, which angers a monster _after_ the effects
are applied (if it's still alive to be angered).

